WEBVTT

00:56:57.014 --> 00:57:00.847
but to encourage retraining is important.

00:57:00.871 --> 00:57:02.137
The other thing, I think,

00:57:02.161 --> 00:57:06.180
is encourage people to go
into the compassionate profession,

00:57:06.204 --> 00:57:08.736
and to increase the social status.

00:57:08.760 --> 00:57:10.958
An example of that could be

00:57:10.982 --> 00:57:15.307
if we feel elderly care
is going to employ more people,

00:57:15.331 --> 00:57:17.649
but people are reluctant to do that.

00:57:17.673 --> 00:57:19.958
The reason is, we're going to live longer,

00:57:19.982 --> 00:57:22.958
so the need for elderly care
will increase.

00:57:22.982 --> 00:57:26.347
So how do we encourage people
to take on that profession?

00:57:26.371 --> 00:57:32.101
One possible way is to offer
some kind of special assistance